#, c-format
msgid "%s…"
msgstr "%s…"

#: src/Objects/KeyboardVariant.vala:27
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Berdest"

#: src/Views/AbstractInstallerView.vala:55
msgid "Test Mode"
msgstr "Moda ceribandinê"

#: src/Views/AbstractInstallerView.vala:64
msgid "Cancel Installation"
msgstr "Sazkirinê têk bibe"

#: src/Views/CheckView.vala:48
msgid "Before Installing"
msgstr "Berî sazkirinê"

#: src/Views/CheckView.vala:55
msgid "Pre-Release Version"
msgstr "Guhertoya berî belavkirinê"

#: src/Views/CheckView.vala:56
msgid ""
"Only install on devices dedicated for development. <b>You will not be able "
"to upgrade to a stable release</b>."
msgstr ""
"Tenê li ser amûrên ku ji bo pêşvebirinê hatine veqetandin saz bike. <b>Tu yê "
"nikaribî derbasî guhertoyeke aram bibî</b>."

#: src/Views/CheckView.vala:61
msgid "Virtual Machine"
msgstr "Makîneya vîrtûel"

#: src/Views/CheckView.vala:62
#, c-format
msgid "Some parts of %s may run slowly, freeze, or not function properly."
msgstr ""
"Hinek beşên %s dibe ku hêdî bixebitin, bicemidin an jî bi rengekî rast "
"nexebitin."

#: src/Views/CheckView.vala:67
msgid "Your Device May Be Too Slow"
msgstr "Amûra te dibe ku pir hêdî be"

#: src/Views/CheckView.vala:68
msgid "This may cause it to run slowly or freeze."
msgstr "Ev yek dikare bibe sedem ku ew hêdî bixebite yan jî bicemide."

#: src/Views/CheckView.vala:86
msgid "Install Anyway"
msgstr "Bi her awayî saz bike"

#: src/Views/CheckView.vala:230
msgid "Recommended:"
msgstr "Pêşniyarkirî:"

#: src/Views/CheckView.vala:236
msgid "Your Device:"
msgstr "Amûra te:"

#: src/Views/CheckView.vala:242 src/Views/CheckView.vala:246
msgid "Processor:"
msgstr "Pêvajokar:"

#: src/Views/CheckView.vala:258 src/Views/CheckView.vala:262
msgid "Memory:"
msgstr "Bîr:"

#: src/Views/DiskView.vala:46
msgid "Select a Drive"
msgstr "Ajokarekî hilbijêre"

#: src/Views/DiskView.vala:51
msgid ""
"This will erase all data on the selected drive. If you have not backed your "
"data up, you can cancel the installation and use Demo Mode."
msgstr ""
"Ev ê hemû daneyên li ser ajokera hilbijartî jê bibe. Ku te hilanîna danayên "
"xwe nekribe, tu dikarî sazkirinê rawestînî û awaya demoyê bi kar bînî."

#: src/Views/DiskView.vala:71 src/Views/PartitioningView.vala:112
msgid "Getting the current configuration…"
msgstr "Sazkariyên niha têne wergirtin…"

#: src/Views/DiskView.vala:96 src/Views/PartitioningView.vala:145
#: src/Views/TryInstallView.vala:83
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Pêş"

#: src/Views/DriversView.vala:24
msgid "Additional Drivers"
msgstr "Ajokarên vebijêrkî"

#: src/Views/DriversView.vala:28
msgid ""
"Broadcom® Wi-Fi adapters, NVIDIA® graphics, and some virtual machines may "
"not function properly without additional drivers. Most devices do not "
"require additional drivers."
msgstr ""
"Adapterên Wi-Fi yên Broadcom®, grafîkên NVIDIA®, û hin makîneyên vîrtûel "
"dibe ku bê ajokarên vebijêrkî bi rengekî rast nexebitin. Piraniya amûran ne "
"pêwistî ajokarên vebijêrkî ne."

#: src/Views/DriversView.vala:35
msgid ""
"Proprietary drivers contain private code that can't be reviewed. Security "
"and other updates are dependent on the driver vendor."
msgstr ""
"Ajokarên xwedîtiyê kodên taybet dihewînin ku nayên vekolîn. Ewlehî û "
"rojanekirinên din bi firoşkarê ajokar ve girêdayî ne."

#: src/Views/DriversView.vala:41
msgid "An Internet connection is required to install NVIDIA® graphics drivers."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo sazkirina ajokarên grafîkê yên NVIDIA® girêdaneke înternetê pêwîst e."

#: src/Views/DriversView.vala:47
msgid ""
"Proprietary drivers can be installed later through System Settings → System, "
"but an Internet connection will be required for all drivers."
msgstr ""
"Ajokarên xwedîtiyê dikarin paşê bi riya Sazkariyên pergalê → Pergal werin "
"sazkirin, lê ji bo hemû ajokaran girêdaneke înternetê wê pêwîst be."

#: src/Views/DriversView.vala:52
msgid ""
"Include third-party proprietary drivers when installing. I agree to their "
"respective licenses and terms of use."
msgstr ""
"Di dema sazkirinê de ajokarên xwedîtiyê yên aliyekî sêyem têxe navê. Ez "
"lîsans û mercên wan ên bikaranînê me dipejirînim."

#: src/Views/DriversView.vala:75 src/Views/KeyboardLayoutView.vala:54
#: src/Views/PartitioningView.vala:141 src/Views/TryInstallView.vala:79
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Vegere"

#: src/Views/DriversView.vala:79
msgid "Erase and Install"
msgstr "Jê bibe û saz bike"

#: src/Views/EncryptView.vala:27
msgid "Don’t Encrypt"
msgstr "Şîfre neke"

#: src/Views/EncryptView.vala:53
msgid "Enable Drive Encryption"
msgstr "Şîfrekirina ajokerê çalak bike"

#: src/Views/EncryptView.vala:58
msgid ""
"Data will only be protected from others with physical access to this device "
"when it is shut down."
msgstr ""
"Dane wê tenê dema ku ev amûr girtî be ji kesên ku gihîştina fizîkî ya wan bi "
"vê amûrê re heye werin parastin."

#: src/Views/EncryptView.vala:64
msgid ""
"The encryption password will be required each time this device is turned on. "
"If you forget it, <b>you will not be able to recover data.</b>"
msgstr ""
"Her carê ku ev amûr tê vêxisitn, wê borînpeyva şîfrekirinê were xwestin. Ku "
"tu wê bîr bikî, <b>tu yê nikaribî daneyan vegerînî.</b>"

#: src/Views/EncryptView.vala:70
msgid ""
"A built-in or USB keyboard will be required to type the encryption password "
"each time this device is turned on."
msgstr ""
"Ji bo nivîsandina borînpeyva şîfrekirinê her carê ku ev amûr tê vêxistin, "
"kilîtdankeke hundirîn an ya USB wê pêwîst be."

#: src/Views/EncryptView.vala:89
msgid "Encryption Password"
msgstr "Borînpeyva şîfrekirinê"

#: src/Views/EncryptView.vala:91
msgid ""
"A unique password for this device, not the password for your user account."
msgstr ""
"Borînpeyveke taybet ji bo vê amûrê, ne borînpeyva ji bo jimara bikarhêner a "
"te."

#: src/Views/EncryptView.vala:106
msgid "Confirm Password"
msgstr "Borînpeyvê piştrast bike"

#: src/Views/EncryptView.vala:129
msgid "Set Encryption Password"
msgstr "Borînpeyva şîfrekirinê saz bike"

#: src/Views/EncryptView.vala:204
msgid "Acceptable password"
msgstr "Borînpeyv guncav e"

#: src/Views/EncryptView.vala:206
msgid "Good password"
msgstr "Borînpeyv baş e"

#: src/Views/EncryptView.vala:208
msgid "Great password"
msgstr "Borînpeyv gelekî baş e"

#: src/Views/EncryptView.vala:229
msgid "Passwords do not match"
msgstr "Borînpeyv ne wek hev in"

#: src/Views/EncryptView.vala:235
msgid "Passwords match"
msgstr "Borînpeyv wek hev in"

#: src/Views/ErrorView.vala:31
msgid "Could Not Install"
msgstr "ŞêwazaŞêwaza"

#: src/Views/ErrorView.vala:35
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Installing %s failed, possibly due to a hardware error. The device may not "
"restart properly. You can try the following:"
msgstr ""
"Sazkirina %s têk çû, dibe ku ji ber şaşetiyeke alavê be. Dibe ku amûr bi "
"rengekî rast ji nû ve dest pê neke. Tu dikarî van tiştan hewl bidî:"

#: src/Views/ErrorView.vala:45
msgid "Try the installation again"
msgstr "Sazkirinê dîsa hewl bide"

#: src/Views/ErrorView.vala:55
msgid "Use Demo Mode and try to manually recover"
msgstr "Awaya demoyê bi kar bîne û hewl bide ku bi destan vegerînî"

#: src/Views/ErrorView.vala:64
msgid "Restart the device and boot from another drive"
msgstr "Amûrê ji nû ve bide destpêkirin û ji ajokereke din bar bike"

#: src/Views/ErrorView.vala:69
msgid "Details"
msgstr "Hûrgilî"

#: src/Views/ErrorView.vala:114 src/Views/SuccessView.vala:61
msgid "Restart Device"
msgstr "Amûrê ji nû ve bide destpêkirin"

#: src/Views/ErrorView.vala:116 src/Views/TryInstallView.vala:36
msgid "Try Demo Mode"
msgstr "Awaya demoyê hewl bide"

#: src/Views/ErrorView.vala:118
msgid "Try Installing Again"
msgstr "Sazkirinê dîsa hewl bide"

#: src/Views/KeyboardLayoutView.vala:30
msgid "Input Language"
msgstr "Zimanê ketanê"

#: src/Views/KeyboardLayoutView.vala:32
msgid "Select Keyboard Layout"
msgstr "Şêwaza kilîtdankê hilbijêre"

#: src/Views/KeyboardLayoutView.vala:39
msgid "Type to test your layout"
msgstr "Binivîse da ku şêwaza kilîtdanka xwe test bikî"

#: src/Views/KeyboardLayoutView.vala:42
msgid "Show keyboard layout"
msgstr "Şêwaza kilîtdankê nîşan bide"

#: src/Views/KeyboardLayoutView.vala:58 src/Views/LanguageView.vala:104
msgid "Select"
msgstr "Hilbijêre"

#: src/Views/LanguageView.vala:67
msgid "Languages"
msgstr "Ziman"

#: src/Views/LanguageView.vala:272
msgid "Select a Language"
msgstr "Zimanekî hilbijêre"

#: src/Views/LanguageView.vala:295 src/Views/LanguageView.vala:355
msgid "Currently active language"
msgstr "Zimanê niha çalak"

#: src/Views/PartitioningView.vala:51
msgid "Select Partitions"
msgstr "Beşkirinan hilbijêre"

#: src/Views/PartitioningView.vala:56
msgid ""
"Selecting “Format” will erase <i>all</i> data on the selected partition."
msgstr ""
"Hilbijartina \"Format bike\" wê <i>hemû</i> daneyên li ser beşkirinê "
"hilbijartî jê bibe."

#. Device is in BIOS mode, so we just require a root partition
#: src/Views/PartitioningView.vala:65
msgid "You must at least select a <b>Root (/)</b> partition."
msgstr "Divê tu herî kêm beşkirineke <b>Root (/)</b> hilbijêrî."

#. Device is in EFI mode, so we also require a boot partition
#: src/Views/PartitioningView.vala:69
msgid ""
"You must at least select a <b>Root (/)</b> partition and an optional <b>Boot "
"(/boot/efi)</b> partition."
msgstr ""
"Divê tu herî kêm beşkirineke <b>Root (/)</b> û beşkirineke vebijêrkî ya <b>"
"Boot (/boot/efi)</b> hilbijêrî."

#: src/Views/PartitioningView.vala:80
msgid "It is also recommended to select a <b>Swap</b> partition."
msgstr "Her wiha tê pêşniyarkirin ku tu beşkirineke <b>Swap</b> hilbijêrî."

#: src/Views/PartitioningView.vala:138
msgid "Modify Partitions…"
msgstr "Beşkirinê biguhêrîne…"

#: src/Views/PartitioningView.vala:283
msgid "EFI partition has the wrong file system"
msgstr "Pergala pelê ya beşkirinê EFI şaş e"

#: src/Views/PartitioningView.vala:285
msgid "EFI partition is too small"
msgstr "Beşkirina EFI pir piçûk e"

#: src/Views/PartitioningView.vala:288
msgid "Invalid file system for root"
msgstr "Pergala pelê ya ji bo root nederbasdar e"

#: src/Views/PartitioningView.vala:290
msgid "Invalid file system for home"
msgstr "Pergala pelê ya ji bo home nederbasdar e"

#: src/Views/ProgressView.vala:64 src/Views/ProgressView.vala:99
msgid "Show log"
msgstr "Tomarê nîşan bide"

#: src/Views/ProgressView.vala:90
msgid "Installing"
msgstr "Tê sazkirin"

#: src/Views/ProgressView.vala:95
msgid "Hide log"
msgstr "Tomarê veşêre"

#. /TRANSLATORS: The current step of the installer back-end
#: src/Views/ProgressView.vala:224
msgid "Partitioning Drive"
msgstr "Ajoker tê beşkirin"

#. /TRANSLATORS: The current step of the installer back-end
#: src/Views/ProgressView.vala:229
msgid "Extracting Files"
msgstr "Pel têne derxistin"

#. /TRANSLATORS: The current step of the installer back-end
#: src/Views/ProgressView.vala:234
msgid "Configuring the System"
msgstr "Pergal tê sazkirin"

#. /TRANSLATORS: The current step of the installer back-end
#: src/Views/ProgressView.vala:239
msgid "Finishing the Installation"
msgstr "Sazkirin tê qedandin"

#: src/Views/TryInstallView.vala:26
msgid "Try or Install"
msgstr "Test bike yan jî saz bike"

#: src/Views/TryInstallView.vala:38
msgid ""
"Changes will not be saved, and data from your previous OS will be unchanged. "
"Performance and features may not reflect the installed experience."
msgstr ""
"Guhertin nayên tomarkirin, û daneyên ji pergala xebatê ya te ya berê wê "
"neguhertî bimînin. Performans û taybetmendî dibe ku ezmûna sazkirî nîşan "
"nedin."

#: src/Views/TryInstallView.vala:44
msgid "Erase Disk and Install"
msgstr "Dîskê jê bibe û saz bike"

#: src/Views/TryInstallView.vala:46
#, c-format
msgid "Erase everything and install a fresh copy of %s."
msgstr "Her tiştî jê bibe û jêgirtineke nû ya %s saz bike."

#: src/Views/TryInstallView.vala:52
msgid "Custom Install (Advanced)"
msgstr "Sazkirina kesane (pêşketî)"

#: src/Views/TryInstallView.vala:54
msgid ""
"Create, resize, or otherwise manage partitions manually. This method may "
"lead to data loss."
msgstr ""
"Beşkirinê bi destan biafirîne, mezinahiya wan biguhêrîne yan jî bi awayekî "
"din bi rê ve bibe. Ev rêbaz dikare bibe sedema windabûna daneyan."

#: src/Views/TryInstallView.vala:107
msgid "Custom Install"
msgstr "Sazkirina kesane"

#: src/Views/SuccessView.vala:28
msgid "Continue Setting Up"
msgstr "Sazkirinê bidomîne"

#: src/Views/SuccessView.vala:32
#, c-format
msgid "%s has been installed"
msgstr "%s hate sazkirin"

#: src/Views/SuccessView.vala:58
msgid "Shut Down"
msgstr "Vemrîne"

#: src/Views/SuccessView.vala:89
#, c-format
msgid "Your device will automatically restart in %i second."
msgid_plural "Your device will automatically restart in %i seconds."
msgstr[0] "Amûra te dê di nav %i çirke de xweber ji nû ve dest pê bike."
msgstr[1] "Amûra te dê di nav %i çirkeyan de xweber ji nû ve dest pê bike."

#: src/Views/SuccessView.vala:93
msgid ""
"After restarting you can set up a new user, or you can shut down now and set "
"up a new user later."
msgstr ""
"Piştî ji nû ve destpêkirinê tu dikarî bikarhênerekî nû saz bikî, an jî tu "
"dikarî niha bigirî û paşê bikarhênerekî nû saz bikî."

#: src/Widgets/DecryptMenu.vala:66
msgid "Decrypt This Partition"
msgstr "Şîfrekirina vê beşkirinê veke"

#: src/Widgets/DecryptMenu.vala:70
msgid ""
"Enter the partition's encryption password and set a device name for the "
"decrypted partition."
msgstr ""
"Borînpeyva şîfrekirinê ya beşkirinê binivîse û ji bo beşkirinê hatiye "
"şîfrekirin navekî amûrê diyar bike."

#: src/Widgets/DecryptMenu.vala:82
msgid "Password:"
msgstr "Borînpeyv:"

#: src/Widgets/DecryptMenu.vala:95
msgid "Device name:"
msgstr "Navê amûrê:"

#: src/Widgets/DecryptMenu.vala:108
msgid "Decrypt"
msgstr "Şîfrekirinê veke"

#: src/Widgets/DecryptMenu.vala:182
msgid "LUKS volume was decrypted"
msgstr "Jimara LUKS hate vekirin"

